                                            "@type": "DocCommentTextInline@1",
                                            "text": "Breaks x into an integral part and a fractional part, each of which has"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "@type": "DocCommentTextInline@1",
                                            "text": "the same sign as x. The integral part is stored in i."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "@type": "DocCommentTextInline@1",
                                            "text": "Returns:"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "@type": "DocCommentTextInline@1",
                                            "text": "The fractional part of x."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
